{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19108400","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19108400","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1910840001:1":{"text":"あなた……だよね？","source_cn":"你……是你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6A55BCD67AF2F98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910840002:1":{"text":"あの音は……あなたの？","source_cn":"你是那个声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83078BE48C712BE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910840003:1":{"text":"私であり、あなたでもあるわ。","source_cn":"是我，也是你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6CDAE19E4745689","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910840004:1":{"text":"怖がらせるつもりはないのよ。よかったら座って。自分とゆっくり話をすると、以前約束したの。","source_cn":"我不想让你害怕，为什么不坐下来呢？我曾经许下一个承诺，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E4D33540C9098E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910840005:1":{"text":"さあ、座って。自分自身を怖がることなんてないわ。","source_cn":"坐吧，亲爱的我，面对自身，没什么好怕的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EF241F8016DD67B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910840006:1":{"text":"一瞬だけ……自分があ