"document_title_status":""},"say:16:1910840016:1":{"text":"カーリュも、意識を保つために血を流す必要なんてなかったのに。だって、彼も私なんだもの。","source_cn":"我记得卡律为了保持清醒而流血的样子，但他其实不必那么做...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D1B4407DB436BA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1910840017:1":{"text":"あなたも知っているのでしょう？同化が進んだ今、私が経験してきたことは、すべてあなたにも伝わっているはずだから。","source_cn":"你知道这一点，对不对？到了现在的时刻，我曾经历的一切，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AC5922ACAC522FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1910840018:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1910840019:1":{"text":"私が完全な姿で家族と再会したいことも知っているはずよ。あなたがタラサのみんなと会いたいのと同じように。","source_cn":"你知道我想以完整的身份与自己的亲人团聚——正如你现在所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD721B924BD2CD46","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1910840020:1":{"text":"デューラ……あなたの妹で、残り少ない同族の一人……","source_cn":"艾雅，她是你的妹妹，你所剩不多的族人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B86E53FAA4FEE3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1910840021:1":{"text":"私たち